- **BLOCKER** — `reject_zero_test_run` now rejects when `passed + failed == 0`, so skip-only suites fail (src/lib.rs:158).
- **MAJOR** — whole-file parse errors are now recorded even without a `test` block; marker-style bodies still own their errors (src/testing/harness.rs:88).
- **MINOR** — discovery refuses a symlinked root before `read_dir` follows it (src/testing/mod.rs:117).
- **MINOR** — report gate count corrected to the actual `2953 passed`, with Round 5 notes added.

